# Records the README demo. Run from the repo root, on Linux or WSL:
#   vhs docs/demo.tape
# Prerequisites and the root pitfall are documented in docs/README.md.

Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 820
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 0ms

Hide
Type "clear && bash docs/demo.sh"
Enter
Show

Sleep 34s
